one man in each pot side by side, many confidential communications are carried

22
00:01:39,756 --> 00:01:44,954
on over the iron lips. It is a place also for profound mathematical

23
00:01:44,955 --> 00:01:50,079
meditation. It was in the lefthand tripod of the peekquad, with the soap

24
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:54,878
stone diligently circling around me, that I was first indirectly struck by

25
00:01:54,879 --> 00:02:00,719
the remarkable fact that in geometry all bodies gliding along the cyclloid, my

26
