soap stone, for example, will descend from any point in precisely the same time.

27
00:02:07,436 --> 00:02:12,399
Removing the fireboard from the front of the triworks, the bare masonry of that

28
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:18,479
side is exposed, penetrated by the two iron mouths of the furnaces directly

29
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:23,914
underneath the pots. These mouths are fitted with heavy doors of iron. The

30
00:02:23,915 --> 00:02:28,719
