35
00:02:46,955 --> 00:02:49,594
us go back for a moment.

36
00:02:49,595 --> 00:02:54,159
It was about 9:00 at night that the Peekquad's triworks were first started

37
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:59,679
on this present voyage. It belonged to Stub to oversee the business. Already

38
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:05,755
there off hatch then, and starter. You cook, fire the works. This was an easy

39
