consumed his own smoke, for his smoke is horrible to inhale, and inhale it you

48
00:03:52,635 --> 00:03:57,435
must. And not only that, but you must live in it for the time. It has an

49
00:03:57,436 --> 00:04:02,954
unspeakable wild Hindu odor about it, such as may lurk in the vicinity of

50
00:04:02,955 --> 00:04:08,399
funeral ps. It smells like the left wing of the day of judgment. It is an

