to leap into their faces. Opposite the mouth of the works. On the further side

69
00:05:34,559 --> 00:05:39,838
of the wide wooden hearth was the windless. This served for a sea sofa.

70
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:44,558
Here lounged the watch when not otherwise employed. Looking into the red

71
