116
00:09:37,275 --> 00:09:41,838
like devils in the forking flames the mourn will show in far other at least

117
00:09:41,839 --> 00:09:51,274
gentler relief. The glorious golden glad sun the only true lamp. All others but liars.

118
00:09:51,275 --> 00:09:56,238
Nevertheless, the sun hides not Virginia's dismal swamp, nor Rome's

119
00:09:56,239 --> 00:10:02,399
oursided Kagna, nor wide Sahara, nor all the millions of miles of deserts and of

120
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:07,518
griefs beneath the moon. The sun hides not the ocean, which is the dark side of

121
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:13,039
this earth, and which is twothirds of this earth. So therefore, that mortal

122
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:19,274
man who hath more of joy than sorrow in him, that mortal man cannot be true, not

123
00:10:19,275 --> 00:10:24,954
true or undeveloped, with books the same. The truest of all men was the man

124
00:10:24,955 --> 00:10:30,318
