128
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:56,558
operas than hell calls kalper young Pascal Rouso poor devils all of sick men

129
00:10:56,559 --> 00:11:01,914
and throughout a carefree lifetime swears by rabbles as passing wise and

130
00:11:01,915 --> 00:11:07,838
therefore jolly. Not that man is fitted to sit down on tombstones and break the

131
00:11:07,839 --> 00:11:12,238
green damp mold with unfathomably wondrous Solomon.

132
00:11:12,239 --> 00:11:17,594
But even Solomon, he says, the man that wanderth out of the way of understanding

133
00:11:17,595 --> 00:11:24,159
